    skos:prefLabel "17 1. This Convention shall enter into force on the thirtieth day following the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-17 ;
    values:originalText "date of deposit of the twenty-second instrument of ratification or accession with the Secretary-General of the United Nations. 2. For each State ratifying or acceding to the Convention after the deposit of the twenty-second instrument of ratification or accession, the Convention shall enter into force on the thirtieth day after deposit by such State of its instrument of ratification or accession." ;
